    <li class="done"><b>Phase 2b — Branches <span class="badge klaar">✓</span></b><span class="oms"><span class="nl">Componenten + layouts</span><span class="en">Components + layouts</span></span></li>
    <li class="done"><b>Phase 3 — Canopy <span class="badge klaar">✓</span></b><span class="oms">Client-side hydration</span></li>
