    <li><b>Phase 5a — Ecosystem</b><span class="oms"><span class="nl">API routes: server-endpoints naast statische pagina's</span><span class="en">API routes: server endpoints alongside static pages</span></span></li>
    <li><b>Phase 5b — Ecosystem</b><span class="oms"><span class="nl">View Transitions: ingebouwde paginaovergangen</span><span class="en">View Transitions: built-in page transitions</span></span></li>
    <li><b>Phase 5c — Ecosystem</b><span class="oms"><span class="nl">i18n-routing: locale-prefixed routes in de router</span><span class="en">i18n routing: locale-prefixed routes in the router</span></span></li>
    <li><b>Phase 5d — Ecosystem</b><span class="oms"><span class="nl">Sitemap & RSS als officiële CLI-integratie</span><span class="en">Sitemap & RSS as an official CLI integration</span></span></li>
    <li><b>Phase 5e — Ecosystem</b><span class="oms"><span class="nl">Middleware: request-hooks vóór routing</span><span class="en">Middleware: request hooks before routing</span></span></li>
